# Research Outputs

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains outputs from research commands. Organized by research type.

## Subdirectories
- `web/` - Output from `/research` command
- `deep/` - Output from `/research-deep` command
- `notebooklm/` - Output from `/notebooklm` command
- `x-reads/` - Output from `/x-read` command
- `x-pulse/` - Output from `/x-pulse` command
- `youtube/` - Output from `/youtube` command
- `podcasts/` - Output from `/podcast` command
